# Remote-Only LaTeX Builds

- Run every LaTeX compilation exclusively over SSH on `ubuntu@neural-os.com`.
- The TeX process itself must execute on that host.
- Never compile LaTeX locally. Do not use local Tectonic, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX,
  LuaLaTeX, LaTeXmk, Docker, or another local container.
- Synchronize the required sources to the remote host, compile there, and
  download the generated artifacts.
- If the remote path, required dependencies, or build command is unclear, ask
  the user. Never fall back to local compilation.
